#. <CLT 4>確かに、なぞなぞみたいだけど…
#. でも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It does seem like a riddle in a way, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か…見えそうな気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like...I can just about see it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダー翔は、
#. 腐川さんであって腐川さんじゃない…その意味が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Genocide Jack is Toko, but *isn't* Toko... What does\n"
"it mean?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、なぞなぞみたいだけど…
#. でも…わかりそうな気がする…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a riddle for sure, but I feel like I understand\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダー翔は、
#. 腐川さんであって腐川さんじゃないって意味…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What it means for Genocide Jack to be Toko, but also\n"
"to *not* be Toko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>１つじゃなくて複数<CLT><CLT 4>…って事だよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The answer is that...she's not just one person, but\n"
"<CLT><CLT 3>multiple people<CLT><CLT 4>, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
